-- **P4 — Placement discipline:** a decision capable of blocking/refusing must live where the checking apparatus can inspect it.
-- **P5 — Boundary collapse:** move decisions into the checked language and leave only thin, non-deciding shims across the boundary.
-- **P6 — No parallel detector regimes:** do not maintain separate detector sets on the two sides.
